  "readme": {
    "available": true,
    "excerpt": "A tiny fix for DeepSeek Harness Desktop: it caps the lifetime of the desktop browser-session cookies (dsh-auth-) from the default 30 days to 7 days, so stale cookies can no longer pile up and overflow the request header — a failure that prevents the app from starting at all."
